## Project Structure

### Main Algorithm
- `CommonModules/СтруктураСебестоимости/Ext\Module.bsl` - main module with algorithms

### Caching System
- `CommonModules/ikon_cost_КэшированиеРасчётов\Ext\Module.bsl` - caching functions
- `InformationRegisters/ikon_cost_ДетализацияЗатратСебестоимости` - register for storing cache

### Reports
- `Reports/ikon_cost_ФактическаяСебестоимостьПродукции/Ext/ObjectModule.bsl` - optimized report
- `ФСП/ФактическаяСебестоимостьПродукции/Ext/ObjectModule.bsl` - reference report (DO NOT MODIFY)

### Versioning
- `Configuration.xml` - extension version number
- Version correspondence in event log messages

## Key Principles

### 1. Correctness
- New algorithm results must match reference (within rounding tolerance)
- Old algorithm (recursive) is the correctness standard

### 2. Performance
- New algorithm (batch processing) should be significantly faster than old
- Solve N+1 query problem

### 3. Root Product Data Preservation
- CRITICAL: `ПартияПродукции` field on ALL levels must reference ROOT product
- Using current level data when writing causes errors

### 4. Cycle Protection
- Detect cycles in product tree (counter releases)
- Maximum recursion depth limit (50 levels)
- Log detected cycles to event log
- Statistics in `ПараметрыДерева.ОбнаруженныеЦиклы`

### 5. Caching
- Store calculation results in `ikon_cost_ДетализацияЗатратСебестоимости` register
- Invalidate cache when algorithm version changes
- Check for cache existence before full calculation
